caption: Safer Flagrant Displays
tradition-component: safer-flagrant-displays

Cost: 5 points/level

Requirements: Magery 5, Thaumatology 30

You are better at not tearing holes in the world with your magic. Each level of Safer Flagrant Displays allows one High Magic casting per scene that would otherwise trigger a mana surge to occur without triggering that surge. Once you have used all such safe displays in a scene, later castings in that scene that qualify for a mana surge trigger it normally. You may purchase this advantage up to a number of levels equal to your Magery.
